1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Every week, instructional records move between teachers and supervisors.
When lesson logs, deadlines, and follow-ups are scattered, the full picture is hard to see.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Meet Smart E-VISION, the progressive web app for instructional supervision archiving
in Calapan East District.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:34,000
The work begins with a teaching load.
Assigned subjects and weekly requirements give each teacher a clear place to start.

4
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:58,000
A teacher chooses a lesson document. Smart E-VISION reads the file and suggests details.
The teacher checks the information, then submits the record.

5
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:10,000
The document enters the archive with its status, date,
and verification information connected to the submission.

6
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:28,000
A reviewer opens the actual file, examines the lesson plan, and records remarks.
The teacher can see when it has been checked.

7
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:44,000
School leaders can see missing work, documents waiting for remarks,
and submissions that arrived on time or after the deadline.

8
00:01:44,000 --> 00:02:00,000
District supervisors can look across schools, follow records needing attention,
and explore patterns that help guide technical assistance.

9
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:12,000
On a phone, the same archive remains accessible.
A QR code opens the verification record and confirms the official file.

10
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:20,000
From classroom record to district insight.
Smart E-VISION. Clear records. Shared responsibility.
